{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787178586495011001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"moist-short-lionfish","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"4daf923995dd1a111173613c1e5d8c520442c3ba67eca7292b7fd03f75041672","event_uuid":"f751387f-323a-4788-9fb2-e95c569cfe8b","position":{"commit_sha":"940c27edfa6b779d2e04f876ff067f59f4096ce8","position":"1787175326523995001-f751387f-323a-4788-9fb2-e95c569cfe8b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"1fdaa34bffb8367f9de98ffff167f223ddf9f468e19b4b525ed6b93ff138c56f","event_uuid":"2a4042a7-5409-4b80-b286-c7fad4df1ea8","position":{"commit_sha":"bb1136e93ad9f7afa82073fdb5de60bdd299a980","position":"1787175338299273001-2a4042a7-5409-4b80-b286-c7fad4df1ea8"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787175326523995001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"2a4042a7-5409-4b80-b286-c7fad4df1ea8","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"8d78-ef59-83cd-4d76"}],"description":"## Context / Problem\nEvery rebar ticket write on a real store logs\n`WARNING rebar.llm.enrich_drain: enrich drain gate check took 500-740 ms (> 20 ms budget)`.\nObserved on EVERY write in a 2026-08-19 session against this repo's own tracker.\n\nMeasured (worktree of origin/main at 09947b1, warm page cache, 4710 ticket dirs in\n`.tickets-tracker`):\n\n    Q.pending_enrichment(...) x3 -> 797.9 ms, 743.5 ms, 724.6 ms   (pending=0 each time)\n    Q.reduce_ticket x300         -> 38.5 ms  (~0.128 ms/ticket)\n\n0.128 ms/ticket x 4710 = ~600 ms, which accounts for the whole figure. So this is NOT a cold\n-path/first-run cost (it repeats warm, run after run) and NOT a recent regression: the gate is\nLINEAR in the number of ticket directories, and `maybe_drain`'s 20 ms budget\n(`overlap_drain_gate_budget_ms`) is only reachable at roughly <=150 tickets. The store crossed\nthat threshold long ago.\n\n`maybe_drain`'s docstring calls this a \"cheap 'is anything soaked?' check that no-ops in the\ncommon case\". It is not cheap: `overlap.queue.pending_enrichment` lists the tracker and calls\n`reduce_ticket` for EVERY ticket dir, each of which scans that ticket's events three times\n(`_latest` for ENQUEUE / CLAIM / DONE). The common case — nothing soaked — costs a full store\nwalk.\n\nTwo distinct harms:\n1. **Latency on the write path.** `maybe_drain` runs opportunistically on ordinary\n   invocations whenever `verify.suggest_duplicate_tickets` is on, so every ticket write pays\n   ~0.6-0.8 s of pure overhead before returning.\n2. **A dead observability signal.** The budget breach is designed to be a warning an operator\n   acts on. Firing on 100% of writes makes it noise, so a genuine future breach is invisible.\n\n## Approach (to be confirmed by whoever claims this)\nNot yet decided; the point of this ticket is to pick one deliberately rather than let the\nwarning keep firing. Candidate directions, cheapest first:\n- Make the gate O(1)-ish instead of O(tickets) — e.g. a queue-head/soonest-`not_before_ns`\n  marker under `.rebar` maintained by `enqueue`/`mark_done`, so the common \"nothing soaked\"\n  answer needs one read rather than a full store walk. Must stay self-healing (a lost or\n  stale marker degrades to the current scan, never to a missed drain).\n- Or recalibrate/scale `overlap_drain_gate_budget_ms` with store size, and downgrade the\n  repeat-warning to a once-per-process log, so the signal stays meaningful.\nBoth must keep the drain's existing no-op-on-Windows / never-raise contract.\n\n## Scope\n- `src/rebar/llm/enrich_drain.py` (the gate + its budget warning)\n- `src/rebar/llm/overlap/queue.py` (`pending_enrichment`, and any marker written by\n  `enqueue` / `mark_done`)\n- corresponding tests under `tests/unit/`\n\n## Testing\n- A test that plants N enqueued tickets and asserts the gate's work does not grow linearly\n  with N (e.g. counts `reduce_ticket` calls, rather than asserting a wall-clock number, so it\n  is not flaky on a loaded CI runner).\n- A test that a lost/corrupt marker still finds a genuinely soaked ticket (self-healing).\n- A test that the budget warning does not fire once per write on a large store.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The gate's cost on a store with no soaked entries is independent of the ticket count,\n      asserted by a call-count test rather than a wall-clock assertion.\n- [ ] A soaked ticket is still found after the fast path's marker is deleted or corrupted.\n- [ ] The budget-breach WARNING no longer fires on an ordinary write against a store of\n      several thousand tickets.\n- [ ] `make lint`, `make typecheck` and CI's pytest invocation are green.\n\n## Provenance\nDiscovered while implementing task deathful-lettered-maltesedog (8d78-ef59-83cd-4d76); out of\nthat ticket's scope, filed rather than fixed there.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"958e-f4b3-275c-4154","ticket_type":"bug","title":"enrich drain gate check is O(ticket count), blowing its 20 ms budget on every write","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["f751387f-323a-4788-9fb2-e95c569cfe8b","2a4042a7-5409-4b80-b286-c7fad4df1ea8"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787178586495011001,"uuid":"e17c05fb-e2b4-4f15-8724-95a6fa5d83d8"}